      "docUrl": "https://docs.apiyi.com/en/api-capabilities/gemini-3-8-flash/overview",
      "snapshotPageSha256": "60ad49edb28ee9dc13c72e7cefc2ed120ba97a3d65f80b7dc43624069a22fbbe",
      "knowledgeBaseSnapshot": "2026-09-18T04-42-51.697Z-6e0c4634fe56ccfd",
      "claims": "OpenAI-compatible POST /v1/chat/completions; reasoning_effort 有效值 low/medium/high；minimal 在 OpenAI 兼容端 200 但被静默忽略仍计思考费（禁用）；thinkingBudget:0 为原生端完全关闭机制（本通道不用）；定价 $0.75/$3.75。"
    }
  },
